{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:eb722411cfc10d4a","name":"Sonic Damage","source":{"id":"source:reference-eb722411cfc10d4a","title":"Sonic Damage","revision":26734,"timestamp":"2025-07-05T16:44:18Z","sha256":"d73c1891c01c99bc6111560f3742cab940ef54fb071e4047cf67cf15b831f079","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26734","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sonic%20Damage&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-eb722411cfc10d4a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sonic damage is considered to be Energy damage in all ways. However, ranged weapons that deal Sonic damage cannot be ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflected"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflected"}]}," by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},". If a weapon deals bonus Sonic damage (such as those with certain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gear Templates"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gear_Templates","referenceId":"reference:dffe50cb745e8f33"},") in addition to its normal damage and is not purely an Energy attack, the attack can be deflected by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", but the target still takes the Sonic damage regardless (just not the weapon's normal Energy damage) if the attack would normally hit.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
